# Security First

- Never log, expose, or commit secrets, tokens, or user data (Yahoo tokens, PII, league data).
- Secrets come from Key Vault / env / GitHub secrets only. Never hardcode or echo them.
- This app is READ ONLY against Yahoo (`fspt-r`). Never call write endpoints.
- Enforce least privilege on every cross-service call via Entra app roles; validate tokens at the boundary.
- Validate and sanitize all external input before use.
- When a change touches auth, tokens, or data handling, call it out explicitly for human review.
